---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageTitle from '../components/PageTitle.astro';
import Section from '../components/Section.astro';
import Figure from '../components/Figure.astro';
import Collage from '../components/Collage.astro';
---
<Base title="Our Story — Breanna & Eric">
  <PageTitle title="Our Story" />

  <Section>
    <h2>Welcome</h2>
    <p>We’re so happy you’re here. More than anything, we wanted our wedding to feel like time set aside with the people we love most.</p>
    <p><em>We can’t wait to celebrate with you!</em></p>
    <Collage rich wash="right" layout="cluster" overlap={64} items={[
      { src: 'images/story/trail.jpg', ratio: '3 / 2', label: 'Photo: couple on trail', w: 80, tilt: -2 },
      { src: 'images/story/parade.jpg', ratio: '3 / 4', label: 'Photo: Hurricanes parade', w: 56, tilt: -3 },
      { src: 'images/story/vineyard.jpg', ratio: '2 / 3', label: 'Photo: vineyard', w: 54, tilt: 3 },
    ]} />
  </Section>

  <Section>
    <p class="eyebrow">Chapter One</p>
    <h2 class="script">How We Met</h2>
    <p>All of Breanna’s friends were out of town when a random boy she’d been texting asked what she was doing that night.</p>
    <p>Against her better judgment, she said yes to a last-minute date at ZincHouse.</p>
    <p>Turns out, it was a pretty good decision.</p>
    <p>The rest is history.</p>
    <p><em>A last minute date that changed everything.</em></p>
    <Collage rich wash="left" overlap={96} items={[
      { src: 'images/story/arena.jpg', ratio: '1 / 1', label: 'Photo: arena selfie', w: 66, side: 'right', tilt: 2 },
      { src: 'images/story/tree.jpg', ratio: '1 / 1', label: 'Photo: tree selfie', w: 64, side: 'left', tilt: -3, fade: 'mid', pos: '10% 100%' },
    ]} />
  </Section>

  <Section>
    <p class="eyebrow">Chapter Two</p>
    <h2 class="script">Life Together</h2>
    <p>After ZincHouse came a lot more dates, and then Eric got a dog.</p>
    <p>Breanna quickly became part of the training process, and before long their lives were weaving together in all the ordinary ways that matter most.</p>
    <p>There were weekends between Raleigh and Durham, Hurricanes games, good beer, little trips, and more and more time spent together simply because that was where they both wanted to be. Eventually, the back-and-forth gave way to moving in together.</p>
    <p>Travel became part of their rhythm too, whether it was somewhere new or just an excuse to get away, eat something good, and spend a few days together. Somewhere along the way, what had started as a last-minute date had become a shared home, a very loved dog, and a pretty great teammate.</p>
    <p><em>New places, good company, our favorite kind of adventure.</em></p>
    <Collage rich wash="left" overlap={254} items={[
      { src: 'images/story/door.jpg', ratio: '2 / 3', label: 'Photo: couple + dog at door', w: 62, side: 'right', tilt: 2, z: 5 },
      { src: 'images/story/strawberry.jpg', ratio: '2 / 3', label: 'Photo: strawberry field', w: 62, side: 'left', tilt: -2 },
    ]} />
    <Collage rich center wash="right" layout="cluster" overlap={40} items={[
      { src: 'images/story/brewery.jpg', ratio: '4 / 3', label: 'Brewery', w: 74, tilt: -2 },
      { src: 'images/story/troll.jpg', ratio: '4 / 3', label: 'Troll sculpture', w: 56, tilt: 3 },
      { src: 'images/story/hockey.jpg', ratio: '4 / 3', label: 'Hockey game', w: 56, tilt: -2 },
    ]} />
  </Section>

  <Section>
    <p class="eyebrow">Chapter Three</p>
    <h2 class="script">Engagement</h2>
    <p>By the time Eric was ready to propose, he knew one thing for certain: Breanna needed to be surprised.</p>
    <p>So he made sure the people closest to her were in on the plan, and somehow managed to keep the whole thing a secret.</p>
    <p>That included secretly flying to New York to get the ring without Breanna having any idea.</p>
    <p>On May 29, Breanna came home from work fully expecting the evening to involve Game 5 of the Hurricanes–Canadiens series.</p>
    <p>Instead, she walked into the backyard to find Eric, a ring, and their family and friends waiting to surprise her.</p>
    <p>The Canes would have to wait.</p>
    <Collage wash="right" overlap={96} items={[
      { src: 'images/story/proposal.jpg', ratio: '3 / 2', label: 'Photo: proposal arch', w: 76, side: 'left', tilt: -2 },
      { src: 'images/story/reaction.jpg', ratio: '5 / 4', label: 'Photo: reaction', w: 56, side: 'right', tilt: 3 },
      { src: 'images/story/group.jpg', ratio: '3 / 2', label: 'Photo: family & friends', w: 72, side: 'left', tilt: -2 },
    ]} />
  </Section>

  <Section>
    <p class="eyebrow">Chapter Four</p>
    <h2 class="script">And Now, Tuscany.</h2>
    <p>All of these moments, the people, the places, the adventures, have brought us here. To a quieter chapter, filled with gratitude for what we’ve built and excitement for what’s ahead.</p>
    <p>We can’t wait to celebrate our wedding in Tuscany with the people who mean the most to us.</p>
    <Collage wash="left" accent="peach" items={[
      { src: 'images/story/porch.jpg', ratio: '3 / 4', label: 'Photo: couple on porch', w: 72, side: 'center', tilt: 1 },
    ]} />
  </Section>
</Base>

